        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for stripe_count_min/is_tgt_used",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for stripe_count_min/is_tgt_used\n\nlod_stripe_count_min() computes the minimum number of unique OSTs an\nallocator must place for a component before falling back (EC geometry\nshrink, or a partial plain allocation); lod_qos_is_tgt_used() checks\nthe per-thread \"targets used so far\" scratch array an allocator fills\nvia lod_qos_tgt_in_use(). Both were untested.\n\nAdd lod_qos_helpers_test.c: plain, default-stripe, EC-data single/\nmulti raid-set (with and without overstriping) and parity cases for\nlod_stripe_count_min(), and an unused/used/out-of-range/stripes-limit\ncase for lod_qos_is_tgt_used().\n\nExport both functions, needed by the new test module, and register it\nin lustre/kunit/Makefile, KUNIT.modules_list and lod/KUNIT.list.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: I856e7608cb71984a499f20c6538a05823f91306e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
